{"resourceIdentifier":"2582","resourceName":"Zhijiang Shibaoshan LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Zhijiang Shibaoshan LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at the Shibaoshan landfill site in Zhijiang city, Hubei province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to capture and utilized the landfill gas for power generation. The electricity generated by the project is supplied to Central China Power Grid (CCPG). The new gas extraction and utilization systems has been installed by the project. \r\nThe total installed capacity of the project is 1.067MW. The project is expected to supply a total of 81,092 MWh electricity to CCPG during the fixed 10-year crediting period, with the annual average amount of 8,109 MWh.","location":{"latitude":30.379152,"longitude":111.603825},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-09-13","endExclusive":"2021-10-14","endInclusive":"2021-10-13"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2582"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhijiang Xinzhongshui Chufeng Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2582"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"44138"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/03/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","v